### ==============================================================================
### TRADO FIREBASE BACKEND — LOCAL REST CLIENT / POSTMAN API COLLECTION
### 
### Requirements:
### 1. Firebase Emulators running: firebase emulators:start --only auth,functions,firestore
### 2. VS Code Extension: "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) or import into Postman
### 3. Local Emulator Ports:
###    - Auth: 9099
###    - Cloud Functions: 5001
###    - Cloud Firestore: 8080
### ==============================================================================

@authHost = http://127.0.0.1:9099
@functionsHost = http://127.0.0.1:5001/trado-x/asia-south1
@projectId = trado-x

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. SYSTEM & DIAGNOSTICS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Health Check (Public, No Auth Required)
POST {{functionsHost}}/healthCheck
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {}
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTHENTICATION (LOCAL EMULATOR ID TOKEN EXCHANGE)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Sign in as Super Admin (Local Emulator Token)
# @name adminSignIn
POST {{authHost}}/identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signInWithPassword?key=fake-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@trado.local",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "returnSecureToken": true
}

### Save Admin Token
@adminToken = {{adminSignIn.response.body.idToken}}

### 2.2 Sign in as Tenant Owner
# @name ownerSignIn
POST {{authHost}}/identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signInWithPassword?key=fake-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@acme.local",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "returnSecureToken": true
}

### Save Owner Token
@ownerToken = {{ownerSignIn.response.body.idToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. SESSION BOOTSTRAP & CAPABILITIES
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 authMe - Bootstrap User Profile, Active Memberships & Resolved Permissions
POST {{functionsHost}}/authMe
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "data": {}
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. CATALOGS & REFERENCE DATA
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Permission Catalog List
POST {{functionsHost}}/permissionCatalogList
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "data": {}
}

### 4.2 Platform Modules List
POST {{functionsHost}}/modulesList
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "data": {}
}

### 4.3 Tax Regimes List
POST {{functionsHost}}/taxRegimesList
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "data": {}
}

### 4.4 Subscription Plans List
POST {{functionsHost}}/plansList
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "data": {}
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. ORGANIZATIONS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Create Organization (Super Admin Only)
POST {{functionsHost}}/organizationsCreate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "data": {
    "name": "Acme Retail Ltd",
    "businessType": "retail_only",
    "businessCategory": "grocery_fmcg",
    "country": "IN",
    "currency": "INR",
    "taxRegimeCode": "INDIA_GST",
    "ownerEmail": "owner@acme.local",
    "ownerPassword": "Password123!",
    "ownerName": "John Doe",
    "planId": "plan_growth",
    "idempotencyKey": "req_org_create_001"
  }
}

### 5.2 List Organizations
POST {{functionsHost}}/organizationsList
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "data": {
    "pageSize": 10
  }
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. EMPLOYEES & STAFF
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Create Employee (Owner / Admin)
POST {{functionsHost}}/employeesCreate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "data": {
    "organizationId": "org_test_123",
    "email": "cashier@acme.local",
    "password": "Password123!",
    "name": "Jane Cashier",
    "roleId": "role_employee",
    "idempotencyKey": "req_emp_create_001"
  }
}

### 6.2 List Employees
POST {{functionsHost}}/employeesList
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "data": {
    "organizationId": "org_test_123",
    "pageSize": 20
  }
}

